# Blinkit Sales Analysis Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project analyzes Blinkit sales data using Power BI to understand business performance and sales trends.

## Tools & Technologies
- Power BI
- Microsoft Excel
- Power Query
- DAX

## Key Performance Indicators
- Total Sales
- Average Sales
- Number of Items
- Average Rating

## Dashboard Features
- Sales by Item Type
- Outlet Location Analysis
- Outlet Size Analysis
- Fat Content Analysis
- Outlet Establishment Trends
- Customer Rating Analysis

## Project Objective
To analyze sales data and create an interactive dashboard that provides useful business insights.

